---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { BRAND } from '../../consts';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Nashville Small Business Insurance | Independent Advisor"
  description="Independent commercial insurance review for Nashville small business owners — property, liability, and specialty coverage reviewed by an advisor who works for you, not a carrier."
>

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section class="bg-navy-900 text-white py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-navy-300 mb-6" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <a href="/services" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Services</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-gold-400">Small Business</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-serif font-bold mb-4">Small Business Insurance</h1>
      <p class="text-navy-200 text-lg max-w-2xl">
        Most Nashville small business owners are underinsured and don't know it. We review your commercial coverage the same way we review everything else — together, clearly, no jargon.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content -->
  <section class="py-20 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">

        <!-- Primary Content -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-2">
          <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-serif font-bold text-navy-900 mb-6">
            What We Review for Nashville Small Businesses
          </h2>
          <div class="space-y-5 text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            <p>Most small business owners in Nashville buy a policy when they open and don't look at it again. The problem is your business changes — you hire employees, add equipment, take on contracts, move locations — and your coverage doesn't automatically keep up. By the time something goes wrong, you're filing a claim against a policy that was written for a business that no longer exists.</p>
            <p>A Business Owners Policy bundles general liability and commercial property into one package — it's a good starting point for most small businesses, but it's not a complete solution. Depending on what you do, who you work with, and what contracts you sign, you may need separate policies that a BOP doesn't cover. We look at your actual business operations and tell you honestly what you need and what you don't.</p>
            <p>If you're a service business — consultant, contractor, healthcare practice, tech firm — professional liability is the coverage most people skip and the one that matters most when a client claims your work caused them financial harm. Cyber liability is the same story. One data breach or ransomware attack can cost more than most small businesses carry in cash reserves. We make sure you understand your real exposure before you need to.</p>
          </div>

          <!-- Coverage Areas -->
          <div class="mt-12">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-navy-900 mb-6">Commercial Coverage We Review</h3>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              {[
                'Business Owners Policy (BOP)',
                'General Liability',
                'Commercial Property',
                'Professional Liability / E&O',
                'Workers Compensation',
                'Commercial Auto',
                'Cyber Liability',
                'Business Interruption',
              ].map((item) => (
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3 p-4 rounded-lg border border-gray-100 bg-gray-50">
                  <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gold-500 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                  </svg>
                  <span class="text-sm font-medium text-navy-900">{item}</span>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Who We Work With Placeholder -->
          <div class="mt-12">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-serif font-bold text-navy-900 mb-6">Who We Work With</h3>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
              {[
                'Contractors',
                'Consultants',
                'Retail Shops',
                'Restaurants',
                'Service Professionals',
                'Healthcare Practices',
              ].map((type) => (
                <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-gray-50 border border-gray-100 text-center">
                  <p class="text-sm font-medium text-navy-900">{type}</p>
                </div>
              ))}
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Sidebar -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-1">
          <div class="sticky top-24 space-y-6">
            <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-navy-900 text-white">
              <h3 class="font-serif font-semibold text-lg mb-3">Review Your Business Coverage</h3>
              <p class="text-navy-200 text-sm mb-5">
                One conversation can reveal gaps that leave your business exposed. Schedule a review.
              </p>
              <a
                href="/contact"
                class="block w-full text-center px-4 py-3 bg-gold-500 hover:bg-gold-600 text-navy-900 font-semibold rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm"
              >
                Book a Discovery Meeting
              </a>
              <a
                href={`tel:${BRAND.phoneE164}`}
                class="block w-full text-center px-4 py-3 mt-3 border border-navy-600 hover:border-navy-400 text-white font-medium rounded-lg transition-colors text-sm"
              >
                Call {BRAND.phone}
              </a>
            </div>

            <div class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50">
              <h4 class="font-serif font-semibold text-navy-900 mb-3">Related Services</h4>
              <ul class="space-y-2">
                <li><a href="/services/home-auto" class="text-sm text-gold-600 hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Home & Auto Insurance →</a></li>
                <li><a href="/services/life-insurance" class="text-sm text-gold-600 hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Life Insurance →</a></li>
                <li><a href="/services/long-term-care" class="text-sm text-gold-600 hover:text-gold-700 transition-colors">Long-Term Care →</a></li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
